pretty well. And don't worry, you won't be hunting batteries either! This game goes for realism, and Alex knows how to prepare for his live streams! \ud83d\ude09 His batteries are charged and you'll either complete the game or die before his battery does!<br><br>This game was inspired by Urban Exploring YouTuber's that go to abandoned buildings at 3AM to do, what's now known as, the '3AM Challenge'. As we all may know, 3AM is known as the devils hour, and is when paranormal activity is at its highest.<br><br><br>Give it a try... IF YOU DARE!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680530/extras/dd9a3d4b37e660e8bfd0e1bd1fde519b.avif?t=1667046913\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "First person atmospheric horror where you play as a Youtuber! While doing a livestream, solve your way out of an abandoned, open world building which is in need of an exorcist! Demons like playing games, you will have to use your fast wit to complete the 3AM Challenge! Good luck!",
